The City at its discretion may approve up to two (2) model home permits per residential subdivision development with the following stipulations:
1. The streets of the development should be sufficiently complete having Graded Aggregate Base (GAB) in place to avoid the tracking of mud onto adjacent streets;
2. A working fire hydrant must be within 250 linear feet of the model home site; final connection to all utilities must be postponed until final platting is complete and recorded.
